WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:02.420
- We talked with Kelly Rowland
a few months ago, actually,

00:00:02.420 --> 00:00:05.370
and she said that you
were in the room on Zoom

00:00:05.370 --> 00:00:08.330
for the birth of her son, which is crazy.

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.820
I mean, it's super special,
but also, like, what?

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:13.688
Like, you saw all that?

00:00:13.688 --> 00:00:15.800
(Michelle laughs)
(audience laughs)

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.600
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:18.640
- Yeah.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.480
- You! (laughs)

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:21.382
That is.

00:00:21.382 --> 00:00:22.219
♪ Friendship ♪

00:00:22.219 --> 00:00:24.429
(laughs) That is.

00:00:24.429 --> 00:00:25.262
- Listen,

00:00:26.573 --> 00:00:30.590
if I ever doubted my place

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:32.963
in Kelly Rowland's life,

00:00:32.963 --> 00:00:37.080
getting the invitation
to watch her giving birth

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.830
put all doubt out the window.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:42.580
- Oh my gosh, that, it would scar me.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:45.060
Like, I'm glad I never saw
that before I got pregnant.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:45.945
I would've never probably-

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:47.608
- It was beautiful, Kelly!

00:00:47.608 --> 00:00:49.040
It was beautiful.
- You know what?

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:53.783
Michelle, I'm so different.
I'm so different. (laughs)

